The idea of earning cash for studying sounds amazing, especially when I'm already spending over half an hour commuting and trying to study on my phone with whatever small data bundles my grandmother and I can afford from her grant. However, I simply cannot justify paying R50 upfront every month because that money is strictly budgeted for transport and food, and if I run out of data, Thuto.io won't even work for me. I would only reconsider if the platform was completely free to join and zero-rated so it doesn't eat my airtime, letting me actually earn those rewards without risking my family's tight budget first.
